  "action": "question",
  "question_count": 1,
  "is_atomic": true,
  "atomic_questions": [
    "For the fixed cost f_k of using marshaling station k, is it charged once if any positive quantity is transshipped through station k (i.e., a fixed charge that activates the station), or is it charged per unit of quantity transshipped through that station?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for a single policy choice regarding the cost structure (fixed activation vs. per-unit), which constitutes one semantically independent question."
}

